          "summary": "Ormskirk Road (Aintree) - Northbound",
          "description": "Ormskirk Road will be closed, Northbound only, on Tuesday 20 October 2026, from 2200 to 0500 the next day.",
          "advice": "Services 300 and 310 (Tuesday 20 October 2026)\n\nFrom Liverpool will travel as normal to Warbreck Moor, then via Park Lane to Dunnings Bridge Road, then continue via Dunnings Bridge Road, then as normal routes to Lydiate, Weld Blundell Arms and Skelmersdale Bus Station (omitting Ormskirk Road).\nThese services will call at the stops on Warbreck Moor, near Church Avenue; and Liverpool Road South, near Northway.",
