          "advice": "Services 17, 17A and 17X\n\n• From Liverpool city centre will be as normal routes to St Domingo Road, then via Walton Lane, Priory Road, Utting Avenue, then as normal routes to Kirkby/Aintree University Hospital. (Omits Walton Breck Road, Wylva Road and Arkles Lane).\nAlternative bus stops: St Domingo Road, near Everton Valley; all bus stops on Walton Lane; all bus stops on Priory Road; and Utting Avenue, near Priory Road.\n\n• From Kirkby/Aintree University Hospital will be as normal routes to Utting Avenue, then via Priory Road, Walton Lane, Everton Valley, St Domingo Road, then as normal routes to Liverpool (Omits Arkles Lane and Walton Breck Road).\nAlternative bus stops: Utting Avenue, near Priory Road; all bus stops on Priory Road; all bus stops on Walton Lane; and St Domingo Road, near Everton Valley.",
