          "description": "Services 414 and 432 will divert from Mount Pleasant Road from Friday 18 September 2026 for approximately 43 days.",
          "advice": "Services 414 and 432\n\n• From New Brighton will be as normal routes to Mount Pleasant Road, then via Kirkway, Earlston Road, Seaview Road, then as normal routes to Woodside Bus Station/Liverpool. Passengers will be allowed to alight and board at bus stop 2800S23074C Earlston Road, opposite Kirkway. (Omits a section of Mount Pleasant Road and a section of Seaview Road).\nAlternative bus stop: Earlston Road, opposite Kirkway; Magazine Lane, near Magazine Avenue and Seaview Road, near Earlston Road.\n\n• From Woodside Bus Station/Liverpool will be as normal routes to Seaview Road, then via Earlston Road, Kirkway, Mount Pleasant Road, then as normal route to New Brighton. (Omits a section of Seaview Road and a section of Mount Pleasant Road).\nAlternative bus stop: Seaview Road, opposite Earlston Road and Mount Pleasant Road, near Clywd Street.",
          "reason": {
