          "summary": "Belle Vale Road (Belle Vale)",
          "description": "Stagecoach services 217 and 217A will be diverted away from Belle Vale Road, from Tuesday 14 July 2026 until further notice.",
          "advice": "Services 217 and 217A\n\nFrom Halewood Shopping Centre will travel as normal to Halewood Road, then via Grange Lane, Gateacre Park Drive, Barnham Drive, Childwall Valley Road, Hedgefield Road to Belle Vale Bus Station, then as normal routes to Kirkby (omitting Belle Vale Road, Besford Road, and a section of Hedgefield Road).\nThese services will call at the stops on Halewood Road, near Hollytree Road; and Belle Vale Bus Station, Belle Vale Shopping Centre, Stop 3.\nFrom Kirkby will travel as normal to Belle Vale Bus Station, then right via Hedgefield Road, Childwall Valley Road, Barnham Drive, Gateacre Park Drive, Grange Lane to Halewood Road, then as normal routes to Halewood Shopping Centre (omitting a section of Hedgefield Road, Besford Road, and Belle Vale Road).\nThese services will call at the stops at Belle Vale Bus Station, Belle Vale Shopping Centre, Stop 2; and Halewood Road, near The Nook.",
          "reason": {
            "category": "MiscellaneousReason",
            "value": "routeDiversion"
          },
