          "summary": "Road Closure - Wessex Lane/Wide Lane Junction, Southampton",
          "description": "Due to roadworks, the Wessex Lane/Wide Lane junction will be closed n both directions from Monday 26th October until Wednesday 4th November.",
          "advice": "Due to roadworks, the Wessex Lane/Wide Lane junction will be closed n both directions from Monday 26th October until Wednesday 4th November. Services towards Southampton Airport will operate their normal route as far as Burgess Road and will then divert via Stoneham Way until the M27 J5 roundabout where they will take the 3rd exit for Eastleigh & Airport. The U1E will then divert onto Southampton Road to its normal route. The U1A will divert onto Wide Lane and then Mitchell Way  to continue to normal route. The U1N will divert via Burgess Road, High Road and Langhorn Road to continue to normal route. \n\nServices towards the university will operate their normal route as far as Mitchell Way and then divert via Wide Lane, Stoneham Way, High Road  and Langhorn Road to continue to normal route.",
