          "summary": "Charter Row MF1 MF2 Bus Stops, Sheffield City Centre (Sheffield)",
          "description": "From 0400 Monday 10 August 2026 Until 0100 Thursday 17 June 2027 (At All Times For 10 Months)\n\nMoorfoot MF1, MF2 bus stops will be closed due to construction work.\n\nServices 10A, 65, 81, 82, 83, 88, 257, 257A, 257B, 272, 785, SC1, SC2 are subject to stop re-allocation.\n\nServices 10A, 65, 81, 82, 83, 88, 257, 257A, 257B, 272, 785 will now depart from MH5 on Charter Row.\n\nServices SC1, SC2 will now depart from MF3 and MF7 on Fitzwilliam Gate.",
          "advice": "From 0400 Monday 10 August 2026 Until 0100 Thursday 17 June 2027 (At All Times For 10 Months)\n\nMoorfoot MF1, MF2 bus stops will be closed due to construction work.\n\nServices 10A, 65, 81, 82, 83, 88, 257, 257A, 257B, 272, 785, SC1, SC2 are subject to stop re-allocation.\n\nServices 10A, 65, 81, 82, 83, 88, 257, 257A, 257B, 272, 785 will now depart from MH5 on Charter Row.\n\nServices SC1, SC2 will now depart from MF3 and MF7 on Fitzwilliam Gate.",
