          "description": "From 0001 Monday 28 September Until 2359 Monday 16 November 2026 (At All Times For 7 Weeks)\n\nBishops Way at its junction with Burton Road and Burton Road in the direction of Monk Bretton only are both closed due to utility works.\n\nServices 37, 57, 59, 59A, 481, 488 are subject to diversion.",
